    /// vertical facade cutaways, ground lobby entrance canopy, roof deck, parapets,
    /// mechanical fixtures (penthouse, HVAC, antenna), and the outside weather stage.
    /// Pure presentation layer: consumes TowerTopologyProjection with 0 domain mutations.
    /// </summary>
